Additional note (non-binding, for context and responsible use):

This software performs biometric face and periocular identification. It is
intended for investigative lead-generation and research purposes, with results
reviewed by a qualified human analyst rather than used for fully automated
decisions. Users deploying this software are solely responsible for ensuring
their use complies with applicable data protection, biometric privacy, and
surveillance laws in their jurisdiction (e.g. GDPR, BIPA, or local equivalents),
and for obtaining any consent required to process biometric data of the
individuals involved.
